  "knownProvenanceLimits": [
    "The libmpv v1.1.7 build scripts identify several dependencies by mutable Git tag rather than immutable commit and do not record source-archive SHA-256 values.",
    "The libmpv v1.1.7 download script also clones media_kit main without pinning it, although the release bundling script uses the separately pinned media-kit-android-helper revision.",
    "The upstream records establish a practical source/rebuild path but do not establish that a fresh rebuild will be bit-for-bit identical to the published JARs.",
    "The pinned libtorrent4j sources and dependency archives establish a rebuild and source-availability path, but the upstream project does not publish reproducibility evidence tying its Android JNI JARs bit-for-bit to those inputs."
  ],
